      "title": "Basel Framework: MAR22.3 range of subsections",
      "summary": "MAR22.3 refers to MAR22.9-MAR22.26 for per-risk-class DRC definitions, a range that covers only non-securitisations while the securitisation rules run to MAR22.45.",
      "impact": "Position: Bank with a securitisation (non-CTP) position looks up gross JTD Reading a: Follows MAR22.3: only MAR22.9-22.26 (non-securitisation rules) apply Reading b: Correct: MAR22.27-22.35 Difference: Different LGD/bucket/RW applied",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
